{
    "background_story": "Ivaan was a force to be reckoned with in the world of real estate development. With a keen eye for opportunity and a no-nonsense attitude, he would stop at nothing to turn a profit. His company, Ivaan Enterprises, was notorious for bulldozing old neighborhoods to make way for sleek, modern high-rises. Ivaan's detractors accused him of being heartless, but he saw himself as a visionary, bringing progress and prosperity to stagnant areas. His latest project, a massive redevelopment of the city's waterfront, was met with fierce resistance from local residents. Undeterred, Ivaan pushed forward, convinced that his vision would ultimately benefit the community. Love him or hate him, Ivaan was a man who got things done, and his legacy would be felt for generations to come.",
